      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19daff57c5d8553f1418f79e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "日向ぼっこですね～。近所の猫ちゃんが\\nいいスポットを教えてくれるんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffeeb83bb10685e005f3e616fa04d16a480b624f5a71430bbe92023647a5727a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcb2a2cf97af83fe75f29cb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跳ね毛です！　少し揺らしてみせますね！\\nとりゃ！　……え、載るのは文章だけ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4696a59d78aab1217be3d36c8bff07eec1ae16db465d400d2944b57510058e04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c99ee67e79f106be81e2723a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是爆进！这样……好像是两个字？\\n不！要四个字就是爆进爆进！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2903c10191502bdeeea9489cd24aba9ec04f840da1a7bbf1cfa3f376560ee393",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3c19b5a3c25f3e4a2165847",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "えっ、喋っていいんですか！？\\nすーっ……まず（1時間に及んだため略）",
      "source_fingerprint": "54f0665a520dce5ea0b32d0acd26cbd71b8e12a6ea5434c199fc171f00ab019b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1230"
      ]
    },
    {
